1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,020
Ọ dị mma, ihe kacha mma m na-arụ ọrụ ugbu a bụ atụmatụ ọnọdụ netwọk maka ndị na-enye data Etna.

2
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:09,240
Ọ nwere ike ịdị ka obere ihe.

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,320
Ma ọ bụ obere ihe?

4
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,060
Iji na-akwaghi ya, n'azụ ya.

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:15,960
ọ dị mkpa ka ị na-eme atụmatụ nke ọma ma tinye ọtụtụ ahịrị koodu.

6
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,300
nke ya na-eme ka m nwee mmasị n'ihi na

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,440
ihe ọ bụla

8
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:22,320
Ọ na-enye ndị ọrụ ohere inwe ohere na ọnọdụ dị ugbu a.

9
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,000
n'oge na-adịghị anya tupu ha emee ọrụ ọ bụla.

10
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:29,640
N'ụzọ omenala, ihe a na-emekarị bụ na onye ọrụ ga-aga site na mmalite ruo na njedebe nke ala tupu ha amalite.

11
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:30,810
Igbo: anọ

12
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:35,430
Ịhụ ịdọ aka ná ntị ma ọ bụ ozi njehie na-ekwu na onye ọrụ a ma ọ bụ onye na-enye ya adịghị.

13
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:37,650
n'ezie ihe na-eme ugbu a bụ...

14
00:00:37,650 --> 00:00:39,330
Ọ bụrụ na onye ọrụ banyere na ngwa ahụ,

15
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:40,710
Iji mee ọrụ.

16
00:00:40,710 --> 00:00:41,790
Nke a bụ ntụgharị Igbo maka "airtime or desire":

ma ọ bụ oge ikuku ma ọ bụ ọchịchọ

17
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:44,400
ha nwere ike ịhụ ozugbo na telikomunikashọn ha

18
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:49,980
ma ọ bụ na onye na-enye ihe onwunwe na-arụ ọrụ, nke a na-enyere aka ịchekwa oge ma na-eme ka arụmọrụ dịkwuo mma.

19
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,210
N'ime ihe niile.

20
00:00:51,210 --> 00:00:54,030
Nhazi

21
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:56,470
Ọ na-adị m ka ị naghị enye nkwado mmetụta uche m chọrọ n'oge ihe isi ike.
